  "describes_version": "original",
  "as_of": "2023-11-30",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would impose an additional tax on individuals with large superannuation balances, forming part of a package to reduce their tax concessions.",
   "The package would apply a 15 per cent tax to the share of earnings corresponding to the proportion of a person's balance above $3 million.",
   "The tax would apply from the 2025-26 income year, with assessment and payment rules supplied by the accompanying Treasury Laws Amendment bill."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "The bill would establish Division 296 tax as a separate tax liability for individuals.",
   "The tax would not apply where imposing it on an individual would exceed the Commonwealth's legislative power.",
   "The bill would commence at the start of the next January, April, July or October following Royal Assent."
  ],
  "affected": "Individuals whose total superannuation balances exceed $3 million are affected.",
